# Build-context exclusions for the app shell image.
#
# The Dockerfile does `COPY . .`, so anything reachable here lands in an image layer
# and stays there permanently — deleting it in a later step does not remove it from
# the layer it was written to. Secrets must therefore never enter the context at all.

# Build inputs/outputs that the image regenerates for itself.
.cache
build
node_modules

# Secrets. `.env` carries DATABASE_URL credentials and INTERNAL_API_KEY (the shared
# secret with the agent); a deployed environment supplies these as real env vars.
# Verified 2026-07-29: without this line the key was readable inside the built image.
.env
.env.*

# Shopify CLI local state — holds a TLS private key (`localhost-key.pem`), a bundled
# mkcert binary, and dev/deploy bundles. None of it belongs in a runtime image.
.shopify

# Generated route types; `react-router build` regenerates them during the build stage.
.react-router

# Test sources are build-time only and are not served.
tests
